[[File:Super Mario Mash-up.jpg|thumb|Key art]]

'''Super Mario Mash-up'''<ref>{{Cite|date=May 9, 2016|url=http://nintendo.com/whatsnew/detail/super-mario-mash-up-pack-for-minecraft-wii-U-edition|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161112203108/http://nintendo.com/whatsnew/detail/super-mario-mash-up-pack-for-minecraft-wii-U-edition|title=Two beloved video game franchises collide in the Super Mario Mash-Up Pack for ''Minecraft: Wii U Edition''|website=Nintendo}}</ref> (also known as '''Minecraft: Super Mario Edition''') is a [[mash-up pack]] released on May 17, 2016, based off the [https://www.mariowiki.com/Super_Mario_(franchise) Super Mario] video game franchise owned by {{W|Nintendo}}. As such, this mashup pack can only be downloaded and used on their consoles and comes bundled for free with ''Minecraft'' releases on Nintendo platforms. 

It includes a [[skin pack]], [[resource pack]] and a world template.

== World template ==
=== Overview ===

=== Music disc locations ===
Hidden in chests around the map are 12 [[music discs]], a common trope in all worlds built by [[4J Studios]] for [[Legacy Console Edition]].
<gallery>
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Cat.png|At the center of a classic SMB-styled castle filled with lava.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc 13.png|Inside of a yellow-roofed Toad House; there are three chests inside. The one on the right has the disc.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Ward.png|Behind one of the paintings in Peach's Castle.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc 11.png|In a cave filled with lava, in a mountain behind a village on an island.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Mellohi.png|Located behind a Ghost House, which can be only be accessed by going through the puzzles inside.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Mall.png|Inside of a sunken ship; the room with the disc can only be accessed via a yellow pipe nearby.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Chirp.png|Behind a giant locked door (styled like SMB3), which can be opened via a lever on top of a pipe somewhere.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Stal.png|Located at the end of a series of parkour and puzzles in a purple-roofed castle near the Luigi statue.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Wait.png|On top of a platform in the snow biome.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Strad.png|On top of Ludwig's Castle in the Super Mario World section of the map.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Blocks.png|In the final room of the airship on the south side of the map.
File:Super Mario Mash-up Disc Far.png|In the Nether; at the top of a tower behind the Bowser statue.
</gallery>

